@inherits PlannerPageBase
@inject IPlatformFiles Files
@* 任务 / 项目 / 迭代 / 进展共用的一块附件区：文件本体在可配置目录，元数据在库。
   上传走浏览器文件选择（InputFile），不再依赖 WPF 对话框，因此新建、编辑、完成任务时都能用。 *@
@if (ShowPanel)
{
    <section class="task-detail-section attach-panel">
        <div class="attach-head">
            <div class="attach-head-text">
                <span class="eyebrow">@Heading</span>
                <span class="attach-count">@CountText</span>
            </div>
            <label class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm attach-pick @(_busy ? "is-busy" : "")"
                   aria-disabled="@_busy">
                <Icon Name="upload" Size="14" /> @(_busy ? "上传中…" : "添加附件")
                <InputFile class="attach-pick-input" OnChange="OnFileSelected" disabled="@_busy" />
            </label>
        </div>

        @if (_error is not null)
        {
            <p class="attach-error">@_error</p>
        }

        @if (IsStaged)
        {
            @if (Staged is null || Staged.Count == 0)
            {
                <p class="attach-empty">
                    点「添加附件」选文件，保存任务后一起上传。单文件上限 @MaxMegabytes MB。
                </p>
            }
            else
            {
                <ul class="attach-list">
                    @foreach (var item in Staged)
                    {
                        <li class="attach-row">
                            <span class="attach-icon"><Icon Name="file" Size="16" /></span>
                            <span class="attach-name attach-name-static">@item.FileName</span>
                            <span class="attach-meta">@FormatSize(item.SizeBytes) · 待上传</span>
                            <span class="attach-actions">
                                <button type="button" class="icon-btn" title="移除这个附件"
                                        @onclick="() => RemoveStaged(item)">
                                    <Icon Name="x" Size="14" />
                                </button>
                            </span>
                        </li>
                    }
                </ul>
            }
        }
        else if (_items.Count == 0)
        {
            <p class="attach-empty">
                点「添加附件」选文件。附件按条目归集，单文件上限 @MaxMegabytes MB。
            </p>
        }
        else
        {
            <ul class="attach-list">
                @foreach (var item in _items)
                {
                    <li class="attach-row">
                        <span class="attach-icon"><Icon Name="file" Size="16" /></span>
                        <button type="button" class="attach-name" title="用默认程序打开"
                                @onclick="() => Open(item)">@item.FileName</button>
                        <span class="attach-meta">@FormatSize(item.SizeBytes) · @item.CreatedAt.ToLocalTime().ToString("yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm")</span>
                        <span class="attach-actions">
                            <button type="button" class="icon-btn" title="在资源管理器中显示"
                                    @onclick="() => Reveal(item)">
                                <Icon Name="folder" Size="14" />
                            </button>
                            @if (_confirmId == item.Id)
                            {
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger btn-xs"
                                        @onclick="() => Delete(item)">确认删除</button>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-xs"
                                        @onclick="CancelDelete">取消</button>
                            }
                            else
                            {
                                <button type="button" class="icon-btn" title="删除附件"
                                        @onclick="() => AskDelete(item)">
                                    <Icon Name="trash" Size="14" />
                                </button>
                            }
                        </span>
                    </li>
                }
            </ul>
        }

        <p class="attach-note">
            单文件上限 @MaxMegabytes MB · 存放目录在「设置 → 附件」，改目录后可一键迁移
            @if (IsStaged)
            {
                <span> · 新建任务时先暂存，点「保存任务」后随任务一起入库</span>
            }
        </p>
    </section>
}

@code {
    [Parameter, EditorRequired]
    public string OwnerType { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    /// <summary>挂在已有对象上时填写；新建任务还没 id 时留空，配合 <see cref="Staged"/> 暂存。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public string OwnerId { get; set; } = string.Empty;

    [Parameter]
    public string Heading { get; set; } = "附件";

    /// <summary>新建任务时的暂存列表；由 <c>TaskEditor</c> 持有并在保存后上传。</summary>
    [Parameter]
    public List<StagedAttachment>? Staged { get; set; }

    private IReadOnlyList<AttachmentDto> _items = [];
    private string? _error;
    private string? _confirmId;
    private string? _loadedFor;
    private bool _busy;

    private static long MaxBytes => PlannerConstants.MaxAttachmentBytes;

    private static int MaxMegabytes => (int)(MaxBytes / (1024 * 1024));

    private bool IsStaged => Staged is not null && string.IsNullOrEmpty(OwnerId);

    private bool ShowPanel => IsStaged || !string.IsNullOrEmpty(OwnerId);

    private string OwnerKey => OwnerType + "|" + OwnerId;

    private string CountText => IsStaged
        ? (Staged is null || Staged.Count == 0
            ? "还没有附件"
            : $"{Staged.Count} 个 · {FormatSize(Staged.Sum(item => item.SizeBytes))}（待上传）")
        : (_items.Count == 0
            ? "还没有附件"
            : $"{_items.Count} 个 · {FormatSize(_items.Sum(item => item.SizeBytes))}");

    protected override void OnParametersSet()
    {
        if (IsStaged)
        {
            _items = [];
            _loadedFor = OwnerKey;
            return;
        }

        if (!string.Equals(_loadedFor, OwnerKey, StringComparison.Ordinal))
        {
            _confirmId = null;
            Reload();
        }
    }

    protected override void Reload()
    {
        if (string.IsNullOrEmpty(OwnerId) || IsStaged)
        {
            _items = [];
            return;
        }

        try
        {
            _items = Service.ListAttachments(OwnerType, OwnerId);
            _error = null;
        }
        catch (PlannerException ex)
        {
            _items = [];
            _error = ex.Message;
        }

        _loadedFor = OwnerKey;
    }

    private async Task OnFileSelected(InputFileChangeEventArgs e)
    {
        if (_busy || e.FileCount == 0)
        {
            return;
        }

        _busy = true;
        _error = null;
        StagedAttachment? staged = null;
        try
        {
            var file = e.File;
            if (file.Size > MaxBytes)
            {
                _error = $"单个附件不能超过 {MaxMegabytes} MB，这个文件是 {FormatSize(file.Size)}。";
                return;
            }

            staged = await SaveTempFileAsync(file);
            if (IsStaged)
            {
                Staged!.Add(staged);
                staged = null; // 所有权交给暂存列表，关闭弹窗时再删。
                return;
            }

            var added = Service.AddAttachment(OwnerType, OwnerId, staged.TempPath);
            Ui.Toast($"已添加附件「{added.FileName}」");
            Reload();
        }
        catch (PlannerException ex)
        {
            _error = ex.Message;
        }
        catch (UnauthorizedAccessException ex)
        {
            _error = "没有权限读取这个文件：" + ex.Message;
        }
        catch (IOException ex)
        {
            _error = "读取文件失败：" + ex.Message;
        }
        finally
        {
            staged?.DeleteFile();
            _busy = false;
        }
    }

    private static async Task<StagedAttachment> SaveTempFileAsync(IBrowserFile file)
    {
        var directory = Path.Combine(Path.GetTempPath(), "sdemo-planner", "uploads", Guid.NewGuid().ToString("N"));
        Directory.CreateDirectory(directory);
        var name = SanitizeTempFileName(file.Name);
        var path = Path.Combine(directory, name);
        try
        {
            await using var input = file.OpenReadStream(MaxBytes);
            await using var output = new FileStream(path, FileMode.CreateNew, FileAccess.Write, FileShare.None, 81920, useAsync: true);
            await input.CopyToAsync(output);
        }
        catch
        {
            TryDeleteTemp(path, directory);
            throw;
        }

        return new StagedAttachment(name, path, new FileInfo(path).Length);
    }

    private void RemoveStaged(StagedAttachment item)
    {
        item.DeleteFile();
        Staged?.Remove(item);
    }

    private void Open(AttachmentDto item)
    {
        if (!Files.Available)
        {
            _error = "当前宿主不支持打开本地文件，请在主窗口里操作。";
            return;
        }

        var path = Service.ResolveAttachmentPath(item.Id);
        if (path is null)
        {
            _error = "附件文件不在当前目录，可能还没迁移；到「设置 → 附件」执行一键迁移。";
            return;
        }

        if (!Files.OpenFile(path))
        {
            _error = "打不开这个文件，可能没有关联的默认程序。";
        }
    }

    private void Reveal(AttachmentDto item)
    {
        if (!Files.Available)
        {
            _error = "当前宿主不支持打开本地目录，请在主窗口里操作。";
            return;
        }

        var path = Service.ResolveAttachmentPath(item.Id);
        if (path is null)
        {
            _error = "附件文件不在当前目录，可能还没迁移；到「设置 → 附件」执行一键迁移。";
            return;
        }

        if (!Files.RevealInFolder(path))
        {
            _error = "找不到这个文件，可能已被手动移走。";
        }
    }

    private void AskDelete(AttachmentDto item)
    {
        _confirmId = item.Id;
        _error = null;
    }

    private void CancelDelete() => _confirmId = null;

    private void Delete(AttachmentDto item)
    {
        _confirmId = null;
        try
        {
            Service.DeleteAttachment(item.Id);
            Ui.Toast($"已删除附件「{item.FileName}」");
            Reload();
        }
        catch (PlannerException ex)
        {
            _error = ex.Message;
        }
    }

    public override void Dispose()
    {
        // 关闭新建任务弹窗时把没来得及上传的临时文件清掉。
        if (Staged is not null)
        {
            foreach (var item in Staged.ToList())
            {
                item.DeleteFile();
            }
        }

        base.Dispose();
    }

    private static string SanitizeTempFileName(string name)
    {
        var trimmed = Path.GetFileName((name ?? string.Empty).Trim());
        if (trimmed.Length == 0)
        {
            trimmed = "附件";
        }

        var invalid = Path.GetInvalidFileNameChars();
        var clean = new string(trimmed.Select(ch => invalid.Contains(ch) || char.IsControl(ch) ? '_' : ch).ToArray());
        return clean.Length <= PlannerConstants.MaxAttachmentFileNameChars
            ? clean
            : clean[^PlannerConstants.MaxAttachmentFileNameChars..];
    }

    private static void TryDeleteTemp(string path, string directory)
    {
        try
        {
            if (File.Exists(path))
            {
                File.Delete(path);
            }

            if (Directory.Exists(directory))
            {
                Directory.Delete(directory, recursive: false);
            }
        }
        catch (IOException)
        {
        }
        catch (UnauthorizedAccessException)
        {
        }
    }

    private static string FormatSize(long bytes) => bytes switch
    {
        < 1024 => $"{bytes} B",
        < 1024 * 1024 => $"{bytes / 1024.0:0.#} KB",
        _ => $"{bytes / (1024.0 * 1024):0.#} MB",
    };
}
